#: src/roles.md:3
msgid "Roles"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:5
msgid ""
"Every member of a Zed organization is assigned a role that determines what "
"they can access and configure."
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:8
msgid "Role Types"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:10
msgid "Every member of an organization is assigned one of three roles:"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:12
msgid "Role"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:12
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:14
msgid "**Owner**"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:14
msgid "Full control, including billing and ownership transfer"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:15
msgid "**Admin**"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:15
msgid "Full control, except billing"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:16
msgid "**Member**"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:16
msgid "Standard access, no privileged actions"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:18
msgid "Owner"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:20
msgid "An owner has full control over the organization, including:"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:22
msgid "Invite and remove members"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:23
msgid "Assign and change member roles"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:24
msgid "Manage billing, payment methods, and invoices"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:25
msgid "Configure data-sharing policies"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:26
msgid "Disable Zed's collaborative features"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:27
msgid ""
"Control whether members can use Zed-hosted models and Zed's edit predictions"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:28
msgid "Transfer ownership to another member"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:30
msgid "Admin"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:32
msgid "Admins have the same capabilities as the Owner, except they cannot:"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:34
msgid "Access or modify billing settings"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:35
msgid "Transfer organization ownership"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:37
msgid ""
"This role is suited for team leads or managers who handle day-to-day member "
"access without needing visibility into payment details."
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:40
msgid "Member"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:42
msgid ""
"Members have standard access to Zed. They cannot access billing or "
"organization settings."
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:45
msgid "Managing User Roles"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:47
msgid ""
"Owners and Admins can manage organization members from the Zed dashboard "
"within the Members page."
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:50
msgid "Inviting Members"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:52
msgid "On the Members page, select **+ Invite Member**."
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:53
msgid "Enter the member's company email address and choose a role."
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:54
msgid ""
"The invitee receives an email with instructions to join. After accepting, "
"they authenticate via GitHub."
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:57
msgid "Changing a Member's Role"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:59
msgid ""
"On the Members page, find the member. You can filter by role or search by "
"name."
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:61
msgid "Open the three-dot menu and select a new role."
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:63
msgid "Removing a Member"
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:65
msgid "On the Members page, find the member."
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:66
msgid "Select **Remove** and confirm."
msgstr ""

#: src/roles.md:68
msgid ""
"Removing a member removes their access to organization settings and any "
"organization-managed features. They can continue using Zed on their own."
msgstr ""
